Subject: Adapt original tweak pending storage and current-thread stack

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Keep the original registry/constructor decisions and allocator. A pending
record is sizeof its native layout, including full-width string defaults;
matching deletes return it to the game allocator. Typed value addresses
replace casts between unrelated binding specializations, retaining the
original switch/byte writes. The decomp currently contains no pending
default writers: preserve that source gap without inventing defaults.
Query actual host current-thread stack limits and retain the original
inclusive range test; path algorithms stay original outside diagnostics.

